source: tm/tests/tui_queue_keys.rs
expression: "out.join(\"\\n\")"
---
h         → Redraw                                                                   pane=Month sel=0 focus=-
l         → Redraw                                                                   pane=Tasks sel=0 focus=-
j         → Redraw                                                                   pane=Week sel=1 focus=-
